Package: pdfx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: tesseract-ocr
Suggests: tesseract-ocr-eng, tesseract-ocr-ind
Description: High-performance Terminal & CLI PDF Swiss Army Knife for Linux
 PDFX is a blazing-fast, terminal-native PDF tool designed for Linux.
 It features a dual-mode interface: a scriptable POSIX CLI with clean exit
 codes and an interactive dual-pane Ratatui TUI with 24-bit TrueColor rendering.
 .
 Core capabilities include merge, split, extract, rotate, reorder, compress,
 text extraction, Tesseract OCR pipeline, bookmarks, and fast fuzzy navigation.
